{"3372710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Noble Legacy", "steam_appid": 3372710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4816350, 3829960, 3840980], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372710/extras/bccf9d77d5e648bf8f7cd1b3e6f6be46.avif?t=1788202037\" width=617 height=161 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In the years before the Norman Conquest, you are granted stewardship of Greenwood. Noble Legacy is a third-person medieval kingdom builder where you construct your settlement piece by piece, attract villagers, assign jobs, gather resources, establish production and trade, and provide for your people through harsh winters, afflictions, and raids. Grow your standing, expand your realm, and build a legacy that lasts for generations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372710/extras/e658a301df8baecebc0aa05c3e2d10d0.webp?t=1788202037\" width=617 height=37 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372710/extras/f5b4169695dc999120bf57dfb1423204.webp?t=1788202037\" width=350 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Endure harsh weather, seasonal shifts, and dangerous wildlife as the world itself tests your settlement’s resilience. Prepare for the cold, adapt to changing conditions, and protect your people from threats beyond your walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372710/extras/667fb3ae53231676839cde868a0b69cb.poster.avif?t=1788202037\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372710/extras/667fb3ae53231676839cde868a0b69cb.webm?t=1788202037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372710/extras/667fb3ae53231676839cde868a0b69cb.mp4?t=1788202037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372710/extras/2461673d0604bfde61d44450c614fdc9.webp?t=1788202037\" width=333 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experience a deep kingdom management simulator elevated through a dynamic third-person perspective. Effortlessly toggle between a strategic top-down view to oversee and govern your realm and an immersive third-person view to explore your lands, connect with your people, and build your kingdom’s future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372710/extras/88aae2cc8270a6e15d1804fbcc369e0d.poster.avif?t=1788202037\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372710/extras/88aae2cc8270a6e15d1804fbcc369e0d.webm?t=1788202037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372710/extras/88aae2cc8270a6e15d1804fbcc369e0d.mp4?t=1788202037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372710/extras/b6b305f02d9f34488f05da5bc5ab27df.webp?t=1788202037\" width=333 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Venture beyond familiar paths to uncover quests, discoverable points of interest, and strategic locations across the Greenwood. Scout resource-rich regions, defensible terrain, and ideal settlement sites as exploration directly informs your expansion and long-term survival. Through Early Access, Discover Quests, Easter Eggs, Loot, Bosses and Discoverable Villagers to recruit as we expand on content with your direct feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372710/extras/f21f3efe6964e06a2075033f1268c336.poster.avif?t=1788202037\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372710/extras/f21f3efe6964e06a2075033f1268c336.webm?t=1788202037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372710/extras/f21f3efe6964e06a2075033f1268c336.mp4?t=1788202037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372710/extras/0d6ddf79557a0f5270562700e38ad68f.webp?t=1788202037\" width=400 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Attract the most valuable villagers in the land and turn them into loyal followers to strengthen your kingdom. Ensure their homes are properly furnished, entertainment is plentiful and provide cutting-edge tools to sustain their loyalty and boost their productivity. How many of the land’s greatest talents will you inspire to serve your cause?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372710/extras/8b421b313679f6a7eea5953a247b6ac1.poster.avif?t=1788202037\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372710/extras/8b421b313679f6a7eea5953a247b6ac1.webm?t=1788202037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372710/extras/8b421b313679f6a7eea5953a247b6ac1.mp4?t=1788202037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372710/extras/61c8fad76f84d9aad6249bb3c82f3a8e.webp?t=1788202037\" width=400 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The lands beyond your settlement are unforgiving. Brigands roam the open countryside, rival barons stake their claims, and the wild itself poses a constant threat to the unprepared. As your domain grows, so too does the attention it attracts—raids intensify, dangers escalate, and survival becomes a test of foresight rather than reaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Prepare defenses, arm your people, and secure vital resources to withstand mounting pressure. Whether facing organized bandit camps, roaming wildlife, or the slow collapse brought on by neglect, every decision shapes your ability to endure in a world that does not forgive weakness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Throughout Early Access we plan to develop and expand on Raids, Alliances, Edicts to establish increased security for your settlement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372710/extras/186c0b617980deaad0a63f872f0a08ee.poster.avif?t=1788202037\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372710/extras/186c0b617980deaad0a63f872f0a08ee.webm?t=1788202037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372710/extras/186c0b617980deaad0a63f872f0a08ee.mp4?t=1788202037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372710/extras/0c160b2f3875f1896cd9a616ea2fb93f.webp?t=1788202037\" width=600 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Craft tools, weapons, armor, and goods through layered production chains that fuel a living economy. Assign roles, manage resources, and turn surplus into profit as visitors and traders transform your settlement into a regional trade hub. Complexity grows alongside your population, rewarding thoughtful planning and skilled leadership. As Early Access progresses, experience more recipes, rewards, and crafting disciplines to expand your productivity &amp; security.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372710/extras/1c627f3e8bf87d1cec670381d678a78d.poster.avif?t=1788202037\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372710/extras/1c627f3e8bf87d1cec670381d678a78d.webm?t=1788202037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372710/extras/1c627f3e8bf87d1cec670381d678a78d.mp4?t=1788202037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372710/extras/268209d9579676ad58676d6ecb5a9b38.webp?t=1788202037\" width=500 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Engage with rival barons, neighboring villages, and influential figures through diplomacy, reputation, and hard-won alliances. Every decision shapes how the realm responds to your rule. Will your decisions place Duke William on the Throne of England? Or will Normandy look within itself for new leadership?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Throughout Early Access we plan to develop and expand on Diplomacy which will trigger rivalries, battles, or bolster trade through alliances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372710/extras/131cb23880398c476f683b211a274d72.poster.avif?t=1788202037\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372710/extras/131cb23880398c476f683b211a274d72.webm?t=1788202037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372710/extras/131cb23880398c476f683b211a274d72.mp4?t=1788202037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372710/extras/2285e628aead1cdf26413d4d4a204b22.webp?t=1788202037\" width=500 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Noble Legacy</i> is an ambitious medieval sandbox built around deep simulation, long-term progression, and player choice. Early Access allows us to develop these interconnected systems alongside the community, ensuring they grow in meaningful and player-driven ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Features in Development Include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer Coop, Ongoing Full Localizations</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early Access gives players the opportunity to:</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help shape core systems like settlement growth, economy, building &amp; diplomacy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Influence balance, pacing, and progression through real gameplay feedback</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience new features, regions, and modes as they evolve over time</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are committed to regular updates, transparent development, and actively incorporating community feedback as the world of <i>Noble Legacy</i> expands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372710/extras/bccf9d77d5e648bf8f7cd1b3e6f6be46.avif?t=1788202037\" width=617 height=161 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In the years before the Norman Conquest, you are granted stewardship of Greenwood. Noble Legacy is a third-person medieval kingdom builder where you construct your settlement piece by piece, attract villagers, assign jobs, gather resources, establish production and trade, and provide for your people through harsh winters, afflictions, and raids. Grow your standing, expand your realm, and build a legacy that lasts for generations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372710/extras/e658a301df8baecebc0aa05c3e2d10d0.webp?t=1788202037\" width=617 height=37 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372710/extras/f5b4169695dc999120bf57dfb1423204.webp?t=1788202037\" width=350 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Endure harsh weather, seasonal shifts, and dangerous wildlife as the world itself tests your settlement’s resilience. Prepare for the cold, adapt to changing conditions, and protect your people from threats beyond your walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372710/extras/667fb3ae53231676839cde868a0b69cb.poster.avif?t=1788202037\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372710/extras/667fb3ae53231676839cde868a0b69cb.webm?t=1788202037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372710/extras/667fb3ae53231676839cde868a0b69cb.mp4?t=1788202037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372710/extras/2461673d0604bfde61d44450c61